@startuml
title PrintXpress - Planned UI navigation flow
skinparam linetype ortho

state "Splash" as Splash
state "Login" as Login
state "Register" as Register
state "Home" as Home
state "Product Categories" as Categories
state "Product List" as Products
state "Product Details" as Details
state "Customize Print" as Customize
state "Artwork Selection" as Artwork
state "Order Summary" as Summary
state "Pickup / Delivery" as Fulfillment
state "Order Confirmation" as Confirmation
state "My Orders" as Orders
state "Order Details / Tracking" as Tracking
state "Notifications / Offers" as Notices
state "Profile" as Profile
state "Manage Addresses" as Addresses
state "Saved Designs" as Designs
state "Print Guidelines / FAQ" as Info

[*] --> Splash
Splash --> Login : no active session
Splash --> Home : valid existing session
Login --> Register : create account
Register --> Login : registration succeeds
Login --> Home : login succeeds

Home --> Categories : browse categories
Home --> Products : local search
Home --> Details : featured product
Categories --> Products : choose category
Products --> Details : choose product
Details --> Customize : customize
Customize --> Artwork : choose artwork
Artwork --> Customize : return with selection
Customize --> Summary : continue
Summary --> Customize : edit choices
Summary --> Fulfillment : confirm summary
Fulfillment --> Addresses : add address\nif needed
Addresses --> Fulfillment : return with address
Fulfillment --> Confirmation : order saved successfully
Confirmation --> Orders : view order
Confirmation --> Home : back to home
Orders --> Tracking : view details
Tracking --> Orders : back

Home --> Orders : bottom tab
Home --> Notices : bottom tab
Home --> Profile : bottom tab
Orders --> Home : bottom tab
Notices --> Home : bottom tab
Profile --> Home : bottom tab

Home --> Info : print guidelines shortcut
Profile --> Addresses : manage addresses
Profile --> Designs : saved designs
Profile --> Info : guidelines / FAQ
Profile --> Login : logout

note right of Home
Main bottom navigation has four destinations:
Home, Orders, Notifications, Profile.
Any main tab can switch to another.
Sample designs appear within Home content.
end note

note bottom of Fulfillment
Pickup needs no address.
Home Delivery requires an address and schedule.
end note
@enduml
